  "courseGuideFaq1Question": "What are today's goals?",
  "courseGuideFaq2Answer": "A cycle of seven exercises starts on the study day after the lesson, with one exercise per study day. If you miss a day, the cycle waits and the goal stays where you left it.",
  "courseGuideFaq2Question": "How do the seven days of exercises work?",
  "courseGuideFaq3Answer": "The app shows the correct move, and the next exercise drops one level, down to a minimum of one star. Solving with a hint also lowers the level and earns no score points.",
  "courseGuideFaq3Question": "What happens if I get an exercise wrong?",
  "courseGuideFaq4Answer": "It is the total stars earned for correct answers without hints, divided by 15. At 70% or above, the theme is firm; below that, you receive reinforcement or the option to repeat the lesson.",
